# Validation

- Enforce maxCharacters, maxWords, maxLines per field.
- Caption ≤ 900 chars; hashtags between 5 and 8.
- Block forbidden words; require required terms.
- Detect unverifiable claims; block REVIEW on critical errors.
- Produce a quality report matching the project schema.
